<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nautica started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nautica started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday analyst Brenda Gall had started coverage of Nautica Enterprises Inc with a rating of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The clothing manufacturer's shares closed on Monday at 27.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
